{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34312","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 六 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水影沈鱼器，邻声动纬车。\n燕轻捎坠叶，蜂嬾卧燋花。\n说史评诸例，论兵到百家。\n明时如不用，归去种桑麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}